License scope for this repository

Original software: 0BSD, as provided in LICENSES/0BSD.txt.
Original documentation and original explanatory website material: CC0-1.0,
as provided in LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt.

Imported Buddhist texts are not covered by either license above. Their actual
CC0 or verified-public-domain status, source, translator, and scope are recorded
in metadata/eligible-texts.json. Third-party source terms remain in force.
Excluded-source metadata does not include the excluded texts and does not
change their rights.
